  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5805.04 Conduct of Hearing. Hearings conducted in accordance with the request shall be heard by a hearings examiner of the Department of Safety.\n\nSource. #6887, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-99",
